{
  "_comment": [
    "Per MUI v7 component: how each v4 `classes` key maps to v7 styling.",
    "slots: classes key -> slotProps key (slot accepts sx – its default element is a styled() component).",
    "hooks: classes key -> { host, selector }. host = where the sx selector must live: 'root' (sx on the component) or a slot name (slotProps.<host>.sx).",
    "  The host matters for portaled content: e.g. Autocomplete options render inside the Popper portal, outside the root DOM,",
    "  so a selector on the root sx would never match – it must go on the listbox slot.",
    "  selector '&.X' = class on the host element itself; '& .X' = class on a descendant. Global states use '.Mui-<state>'.",
    "root: true = classes.root is styled with sx on the component itself.",
    "inferred: host derived from the component's DOM structure, not from a declaration – verify manually.",
    "manual: key exists in v7 classes but is not applied by v7 – cannot be converted.",
    "Verified against @mui/material@7.3.11: <Comp>Classes.d.ts (keys), <Comp>Slots in <Comp>.d.ts (slots), styled() slot definitions",
    "and useUtilityClasses in <Comp>.js (which element each class lands on). Global states from @mui/utils globalStateClasses."
  ],
  "_verifiedAgainst": "@mui/material@7.3.11",
  "components": {
    "Autocomplete": {
      "prefix": "MuiAutocomplete",
      "root": true,
      "slots": {
        "paper": "paper",
        "popper": "popper",
        "listbox": "listbox",
        "clearIndicator": "clearIndicator",
        "popupIndicator": "popupIndicator"
      },
      "hooks": {
        "expanded": { "host": "root", "selector": "&.Mui-expanded" },
        "focused": { "host": "root", "selector": "&.Mui-focused" },
        "fullWidth": { "host": "root", "selector": "&.MuiAutocomplete-fullWidth" },
        "hasClearIcon": { "host": "root", "selector": "&.MuiAutocomplete-hasClearIcon" },
        "hasPopupIcon": { "host": "root", "selector": "&.MuiAutocomplete-hasPopupIcon" },
        "inputRoot": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-inputRoot" },
        "input": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-input" },
        "inputFocused": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-inputFocused" },
        "tag": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-tag" },
        "tagSizeSmall": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-tagSizeSmall" },
        "tagSizeMedium": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-tagSizeMedium" },
        "endAdornment": { "host": "root", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-endAdornment" },
        "popupIndicatorOpen": { "host": "popupIndicator", "selector": "&.MuiAutocomplete-popupIndicatorOpen" },
        "popperDisablePortal": { "host": "popper", "selector": "&.MuiAutocomplete-popperDisablePortal" },
        "option": { "host": "listbox", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-option", "inferred": true },
        "groupLabel": { "host": "listbox", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-groupLabel", "inferred": true },
        "groupUl": { "host": "listbox", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-groupUl", "inferred": true },
        "loading": { "host": "paper", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-loading", "inferred": true },
        "noOptions": { "host": "paper", "selector": "& .MuiAutocomplete-noOptions", "inferred": true },
        "focusVisible": { "manual": "focusVisible מוגדר ב-autocompleteClasses אך אינו מוחל ב-v7" }
      }
    },
    "Dialog": {
